  "description": "Change of use from Use Class C3 (dwelling house) to Use Class C4 (HMO-house in multiple occupation).",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be implemented in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:\r\rLocation and Block Plan - CG23-01 Rev. 001\rProposed Floor and Roof Plans - CG24-04 Rev. 001\rProposed Elevations and Section Plan - CG23-05 Rev. 001\r\rOther documents submitted with the application\rHighways Proforma\rFlood Risk Assessment\rPlanning Statement\r\t\t      \rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 6 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "No independent cooking or laundry facilities shall be installed in any of the respective bedrooms and the communal kitchen and dining room shall be retained in perpetuity.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r"
  ],
